      en: ["Founded in 1974 and officially opened in 1976.", "It possesses more than 9,000 works of Venezuelan art.", "The new building on Avenida México covers 30,000 square meters.", "It houses Arturo Michelena's famous work 'Miranda in La Carraca'.", "It is the largest museum building in Venezuela.", "The collection spans works from the 17th century to the present day."],
