      en: "The impressive auditorium of the University of Venezuela, world-famous for its acoustic 'clouds' by Alexander Calder.",
      es: "El impresionante auditorio de la Universidad Central de Venezuela, famoso por sus 'nubes' acústicas de Alexander Calder.",
